Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:07.96,Base,,0,0,0,,JUST CAN'T SAY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.28,Base,,0,0,0,,IT. YEAH. DO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.00,Base,,0,0,0,,YOU REMEMBER WHAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:10.64,Base,,0,0,0,,THAT FELT LIKE?
