Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:12.84,Base,,0,0,0,,IN YOUR THROAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:14.16,Base,,0,0,0,,DOES IT GET
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.30,Base,,0,0,0,,FRUSTRATING? YEAH, IT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:15.94,Base,,0,0,0,,DOES GET FRUSTRATING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:16.66,Base,,0,0,0,,AFTER A WHILE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:18.68,Base,,0,0,0,,I MEAN, YOU'RE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:19.50,Base,,0,0,0,,LUCKY BECAUSE YOU
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.40,Base,,0,0,0,,GOT LANGUAGE, BUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:20.88,Base,,0,0,0,,THERE ARE KIDS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:21.48,Base,,0,0,0,,AT YOUR AGE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:22.46,Base,,0,0,0,,THAT CAN'T, STILL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.40,Base,,0,0,0,,CAN'T SPEAK. DO
