Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.10,Base,,0,0,0,,HAVE {\c&H6DA5E8&}AUTISM?{\c&HFFFFFF&} YEAH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:52.74,Base,,0,0,0,,YOU DO? YEAH,
